uutils diffutils is a cross-platform reimplementation of the GNU diff
utilities in Rust.

This package installs the same names as textproc/gdiff for the tools it
implements: ${PREFIX}/bin/gdiff and ${PREFIX}/bin/gcmp are symlinks to
a multicall binary.  It conflicts with textproc/gdiff and declares it
as a secondary pkgpath, so the package tools accept it as a provider of
that path.  The GNU package must not be installed at the same time.

The upstream implementation does not (yet) support diff3 or sdiff, so
${PREFIX}/bin/gdiff3 and ${PREFIX}/bin/gsdiff are not provided.
